    "id": "p24-q7-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "A parabola has $x$-intercepts of $-1$ and $2$ and passes through the point $(4,10)$. Find its equation.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$y=x^2-x-2$",
      "worked": "Using the roots and the point $(4,10)$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=a(x+1)(x-2)\\\\10&=a(4+1)(4-2)\\\\a&=1\\\\y&=(x+1)(x-2)\\\\y&=x^2-x-2\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
